  "document": "Eugen Schuhmacher\nEugen Schuhmacher( actually Eugen Josef Robert Schuhmacher)( August 4, 1906 – January 8, 1973) was a German zoologist and pioneer of animal documentaries. Besides Bernhard Grzimek and Heinz Sielmann he belongs to the German wildlife documentary filmmakers with an international reputation."
